{"articleNo":"505126","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=505126&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 쿠팡(CFS) 대졸자 정규직 채용 교육과정 모집","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2025.01.21","hit":"8613","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmFYHoQRkgHAogcQPYHkDOBBAsvAKwCMA3ATwEcAPAVwDkBFAS2QDoD4BzIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">한국폴리텍대학 영남융합기술캠퍼스 스마트물류과는 쿠팡</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(CFS) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 11pt;\">대졸자 정규직 채용 교육과정을 모집합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">모집인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: 12</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">약간 명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">모집기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: 2025.01.16.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">) ~ 2025.02.28(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">면접일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">개별 면접일정</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">지원사항 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">교육비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">기숙사비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">식비 무료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">국가지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">주요취업처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">쿠팡</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">취업연계형 과정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">해운선사 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">MAERSK, GS</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">네트웍스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">, BGF</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">그룹</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">한진그룹</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">, OMRON(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">일본</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">지원자격</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">년제 대학 졸업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">자 및 이와 동등한 수준의 학력을 인정받는 자 또는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">년제 대학 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">년 이상 수료자</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">산업기사 이상 자격증 소지자</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">동일 및 유사 계열 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">년 이상 실무 종사자</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">접수방법</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">인터넷접수 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: http://www.kopo.ac.kr/yct</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">하이테크과정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">만 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">39</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">세이하 대졸자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬돋움;font-size:11.0pt;\">전문대학 이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style